                                                "sense_id": "d2029ac0-fb87-34c8-87c1-271bab79d7ff",
                                                "text": "Lessee now, who else does the old master know?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6759f24-e33d-4395-9327-ff919c7492cf",
                                                "sense_id": "d2029ac0-fb87-34c8-87c1-271bab79d7ff",
                                                "text": "Huh? My name? Lessee... I just came outta that egg, so I guess I don'thave a name yet."
